{
  "name": "Content Factory — Notion Edition",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "hook": null,
        "maxResults": 1
      },
      "mapper": {},
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "restore": { "parameters": { "hook": { "label": "Content Factory Webhook" } } },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "hook",
            "type": "hook:gateway-webhook",
            "label": "Webhook",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "note": "Webhook принимает параметры: ?page_id=XXX&button=start|trans|gpt|lab|gen"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "status": "200",
        "body": "<script>window.close();</script>",
        "headers": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "text/html"
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "notion:RetrievePage",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": null
      },
      "mapper": {
        "pageId": "{{1.page_id}}"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 0 },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "__IMTCONN__",
            "type": "account:notion",
            "label": "Notion Connection",
            "required": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "maxResults": 1
      },
      "mapper": null,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 0 }
      },
      "routes": [
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 10,
              "module": "apify:RunActor",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "actorId": "",
                "input": "{\"usernames\": [\"{{3.properties.`Ник Инстаграма`.rich_text[].plain_text}}\"], \"resultsLimit\": {{3.properties.`Количество`.number}}}",
                "build": "latest",
                "memory": 4096,
                "timeout": 300,
                "synchronous": true
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": -600 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:apify",
                    "label": "Apify Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Route: Анализ (Start)",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.button}}",
                      "b": "start",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 11,
              "module": "apify:GetDatasetItems",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "datasetId": "{{10.defaultDatasetId}}",
                "clean": true,
                "limit": ""
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": -600 }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 12,
              "module": "notion:CreateDatabaseItem",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "databaseId": "",
                "properties": {
                  "Ник Инстаграма": {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "rich_text": [{ "text": { "content": "{{11.ownerUsername}}" } }]
                  },
                  "Ссылка на видео": {
                    "type": "url",
                    "url": "{{11.url}}"
                  },
                  "Preview": {
                    "type": "url",
                    "url": "{{11.displayUrl}}"
                  },
                  "Медиа": {
                    "type": "url",
                    "url": "{{11.videoUrl}}"
                  },
                  "Просмотры": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "number": "{{11.videoViewCount}}"
                  },
                  "Лайки": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "number": "{{11.likesCount}}"
                  },
                  "Описание видео": {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "rich_text": [{ "text": { "content": "{{11.caption}}" } }]
                  },
                  "Комментарии": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "number": "{{11.commentsCount}}"
                  },
                  "Когда добавлено": {
                    "type": "date",
                    "date": { "start": "{{11.timestamp}}" }
                  }
                }
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": -600 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 20,
              "module": "http:ActionGetFile",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "url": "{{3.properties.`Медиа`.url}}",
                "shareCookies": false
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": -300 }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Route: Транскрибация (Trans)",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.button}}",
                      "b": "trans",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 21,
              "module": "assemblyai:UploadFile",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "data": "{{20.data}}",
                "fileName": "{{20.fileName}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": -300 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:assemblyai",
                    "label": "AssemblyAI Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 22,
              "module": "assemblyai:TranscribeAudio",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "audio_url": "{{21.upload_url}}",
                "language_detection": true,
                "punctuate": true,
                "format_text": true
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": -300 }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 23,
              "module": "notion:UpdatePage",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "pageId": "{{1.page_id}}",
                "properties": {
                  "Транскриптер": {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "rich_text": [{ "text": { "content": "{{22.text}}" } }]
                  }
                }
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 2100, "y": -300 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 30,
              "module": "util:SetVariables",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "variables": [
                  {
                    "name": "assistant_id",
                    "value": "{{switch(3.properties.`Выбор`.select.name; \"Перевод\"; \"asst_YOUR_TRANSLATE_ID\"; \"10 заголовков\"; \"asst_YOUR_HEADLINES_ID\"; \"Больше материала\"; \"asst_YOUR_MORE_MATERIAL_ID\"; \"asst_YOUR_DEFAULT_ID\")}}"
                  }
                ],
                "scope": "roundtrip"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 0 }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Route: ChatGPT (GPT)",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.button}}",
                      "b": "gpt",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 31,
              "module": "openai-gpt-4:MessageAnAssistant",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "assistantId": "{{30.assistant_id}}",
                "role": "user",
                "message": "{{3.properties.`Транскриптер`.rich_text[].plain_text}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": 0 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:openai-gpt-4",
                    "label": "OpenAI Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 32,
              "module": "notion:UpdatePage",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "pageId": "{{1.page_id}}",
                "properties": {
                  "Результат ГПТ": {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "rich_text": [{ "text": { "content": "{{31.message}}" } }]
                  }
                }
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": 0 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 40,
              "module": "notion:RetrievePage",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "pageId": "{{1.page_id}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 300 }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Route: Озвучка 11Labs (Lab)",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.button}}",
                      "b": "lab",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 41,
              "module": "elevenlabs:TextToSpeech",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "voiceId": "",
                "modelId": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
                "text": "{{40.properties.`Готовый результат`.rich_text[].plain_text}}",
                "stability": 1,
                "similarity_boost": 1
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": 300 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:elevenlabs",
                    "label": "11 Labs Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 42,
              "module": "google-drive:UploadFile",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "folderId": "",
                "name": "voiceover_{{now}}.mp3",
                "data": "{{41.data}}",
                "convert": false
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": 300 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:google",
                    "label": "Google Drive Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 43,
              "module": "google-drive:ShareFile",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "fileId": "{{42.id}}",
                "type": "anyone",
                "role": "reader"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 2100, "y": 300 }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 44,
              "module": "notion:UpdatePage",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "pageId": "{{1.page_id}}",
                "properties": {
                  "Озвучка": {
                    "type": "url",
                    "url": "{{43.webContentLink}}"
                  }
                }
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 2400, "y": 300 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 50,
              "module": "notion:RetrievePage",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "pageId": "{{1.page_id}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 600 }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Route: HeyGen Аватар (Gen)",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.button}}",
                      "b": "gen",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 51,
              "module": "heygen:CreateAvatarVideo",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "avatar_id": "",
                "voice_type": "audio",
                "audio_url": "{{50.properties.`Озвучка`.url}}",
                "caption": false,
                "scale": 1
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": 600 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:heygen",
                    "label": "HeyGen Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 52,
              "module": "builtin:BasicFeeder",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "delay": 300
              },
              "mapper": {},
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": 600 },
                "note": "Sleep 300 секунд — ожидание генерации аватара"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 53,
              "module": "heygen:GetVideo",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "video_id": "{{51.video_id}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 2100, "y": 600 }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 54,
              "module": "notion:UpdatePage",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "pageId": "{{1.page_id}}",
                "properties": {
                  "HeyGen результат": {
                    "type": "url",
                    "url": "{{53.video_url}}"
                  }
                }
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 2400, "y": 600 }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false
    },
    "designer": {
      "orphans": []
    },
    "zone": "eu2.make.com",
    "notes": [
      "=== CONTENT FACTORY — NOTION EDITION ===",
      "",
      "СТРУКТУРА:",
      "Webhook → Webhook Response → Notion Retrieve Page → Router (5 маршрутов)",
      "",
      "МАРШРУТЫ:",
      "1. START  — Apify (Instagram Reel Scraper) → Notion Create Database Item",
      "2. TRANS  — HTTP Get File → AssemblyAI Upload + Transcribe → Notion Update Page",
      "3. GPT    — Set Variables (выбор ассистента) → OpenAI Assistant → Notion Update Page",
      "4. LAB    — 11 Labs TTS → Google Drive Upload + Share → Notion Update Page",
      "5. GEN    — HeyGen Create Avatar → Sleep 300s → HeyGen Get Video → Notion Update Page",
      "",
      "=== НАСТРОЙКА NOTION ===",
      "",
      "1. Создать Database в Notion со свойствами (properties):",
      "",
      "   | Свойство           | Тип в Notion     |",
      "   |--------------------|------------------|",
      "   | Name               | Title            |",
      "   | Ник Инстаграма     | Text             |",
      "   | Количество         | Number           |",
      "   | Ссылка на видео    | URL              |",
      "   | Preview            | URL              |",
      "   | Медиа              | URL              |",
      "   | Просмотры          | Number           |",
      "   | Лайки              | Number           |",
      "   | Описание видео     | Text             |",
      "   | Комментарии        | Number           |",
      "   | Когда добавлено    | Date             |",
      "   | Сколько дней назад | Formula          |",
      "   | В работу           | Select           |",
      "   | Транскриптер       | Text             |",
      "   | Выбор              | Select           |",
      "   | Результат ГПТ      | Text             |",
      "   | Готовый результат   | Text             |",
      "   | Озвучка            | URL              |",
      "   | HeyGen результат   | URL              |",
      "",
      "2. КНОПКИ В NOTION:",
      "   Создать 5 Button properties, каждая с действием 'Open URL':",
      "",
      "   Запуск:        https://hook.make.com/YOUR_WEBHOOK_ID?page_id={{page_id}}&button=start",
      "   Транскрибация: https://hook.make.com/YOUR_WEBHOOK_ID?page_id={{page_id}}&button=trans",
      "   ChatGPT:       https://hook.make.com/YOUR_WEBHOOK_ID?page_id={{page_id}}&button=gpt",
      "   11 Labs:       https://hook.make.com/YOUR_WEBHOOK_ID?page_id={{page_id}}&button=lab",
      "   HeyGen:        https://hook.make.com/YOUR_WEBHOOK_ID?page_id={{page_id}}&button=gen",
      "",
      "   Notion Button → Open URL автоматически подставит page_id текущей строки.",
      "   Если Notion не поддерживает динамический page_id в кнопке,",
      "   используйте альтернативу: кнопка меняет Select-свойство 'Trigger'",
      "   → Notion Automation отслеживает изменение → отправляет webhook.",
      "",
      "3. ФОРМУЛА 'Сколько дней назад':",
      "   dateBetween(now(), prop(\"Когда добавлено\"), \"days\")",
      "",
      "4. СОРТИРОВКА:",
      "   Создать View с сортировкой по 'Просмотры' (Descending)",
      "   и группировкой по 'Ник Инстаграма'",
      "",
      "=== НАСТРОЙКА MAKE.COM ===",
      "",
      "1. Создать Webhook → скопировать URL в кнопки Notion",
      "2. Подключить: Notion, Apify, AssemblyAI, OpenAI, 11 Labs, Google Drive, HeyGen",
      "3. В Notion модулях указать Database ID",
      "4. В Apify указать Actor ID (Instagram Reel Scraper)",
      "5. Заменить asst_YOUR_*_ID на реальные ID ассистентов OpenAI",
      "6. Выбрать Voice ID (11 Labs), Avatar ID (HeyGen), Folder ID (Google Drive)",
      "",
      "=== ОТЛИЧИЯ ОТ AIRTABLE ВЕРСИИ ===",
      "",
      "- Airtable Attachment → Notion URL (Notion API не поддерживает upload файлов напрямую)",
      "- Файлы (preview, видео, озвучка) хранятся как URL-ссылки",
      "- record_id → page_id",
      "- Кнопки через 'Open URL' вместо Airtable Button с формулой"
    ]
  }
}
